<p>Whenever you would be affected by a detrimental physical effect you instead transfer it instantly to one of your ghouls.</p><p>The ghoul dies from the process.</p><p>While under 1 life it also affects magical and mental effects.</p><p>At most <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 5, 6</acronym> effects can be affected per turn.</p><p>Cross-tier effects are never affected.</p>